stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "Rotating the password" as Rotating
    [*] --> Declared
    Declared --> Provisioned: account created
    Declared --> Refused: local part claimed by another Project
    Provisioned --> Rotating: rotation due
    Rotating --> Provisioned: new password delivered
    Provisioned --> Removed: dropped from intent
    Removed --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    classDef bad fill:#0000a4,stroke:#0000b4
    classDef good fill:#0000a3,stroke:#0000b3
    class Provisioned good
    class Refused bad
